    Implements BUILD-SPEC M1 item 3. next.config.ts redirects() returns 38 permanent (308) rules mapping old Wix URLs to new-site routes; 34 internal (incl. 2 wildcards /blog/:path*, /post/:slug*) + 4 external to the Lightspeed store (SHOP_URL). Operator-approved via ESCALATIONS E6 (2026-07-19): 22 clean 1:1 mappings, plus the 12 decision classes resolved (old store pages + /jewelry -> Lightspeed; blog + 55 posts -> /press; policy pages + /social-media -> home; year archives + Landscapes -> /collection; /bio -> /story direct). Identity paths (/murals /contact /press /collection) deliberately excluded (new site already serves them).
    
    tests/seo/redirects.test.ts: 8 non-vacuous unit tests (exact count, each pair, permanent:true, identity-absence, SHOP_URL drift guard) drove red->green. tests/e2e/redirects.spec.ts: 308 + Location assertion per source (authored; runs at gate). npm run check green: 206 tests (was 198), lint/format/typecheck clean.
    
